 Chance is a RNG based game where you open chests to unlock some of the rarest blades and show them off to your friends!\n\n🎲 Roll to unlock rare blades!\n⚔️  Show off your best swords use them to fight other players in our PvP arena\n💎 Fight gremlins for loot drops, complete quests and unlock achievements for special rewards\n✨ Beat the boss in the dungeon for rewards\n🥇 Be the top on the leaderboards\n🍀 Invite your friends for a luck boost!\n\n\nUPDATE: New environment, new chests, improvements to dungeon, bug fixes & more!\n\nEmotes: /sit1 /sit2 /lean1 /lean2\n\n🤞🏻 Feeling lucky? Join our group for a free luck boost!\n\n👍 Enjoying the game? Let us know by leaving it a like! \n\nTags: rng, hades, multiplayer, rarity, anime, mobile, console, xbox, pc, vr, sword rng, blades, dungeon, boss, boss fight","path":"/game/16349323749-blades-of-chance","slug":"16349323749-blades-of-chance","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/736a66fd7d95ccea4a1519fe53f93e0838b1d1c7ff818108d8200082351338c4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9809f8630d1fdd363d19b7b5998467dd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":15146559,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-04-30T11:49:47.625Z","creator":{"name":"RNG Goodnight","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":16560655288,"name":"Pillar Chase 2","desc":"!! Voucher and game reopening are delayed due to technical issues !!\n\n(This game is DISCONTINUED and will no longer be updated.)\n(Credit to many of the character creators can be found in-game under the Information/ability tab.)","path":"/game/16560655288-pillar-chase-2","slug":"16560655288-pillar-chase-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d8b68efcd21f769f6a8580fb3661b06896d5190fb06ab4aed833f7dc304abeff.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c54285ee483bd44bf01005854d1d2b3b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":206839246,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-12T13:42:24.902Z","creator":{"name"