ver Henderson\".\n- Voice lines are from \"David Near\".\n","path":"/game/15715368401-siren-head-legacy","slug":"15715368401-siren-head-legacy","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/401f3df2e95f6133c186eda06516aec88746685927f28c1fd4dc47bfe7a4da49.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-94209d3b282aac1d7b528d63fb470955/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":268138120,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-17T12:23:38.383Z","creator":{"name":"Middleway Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16347800591,"name":"[📈 2x + 📊 Trading] Anime Royale","desc":"Welcome to Anime Royale 👑 - the ultimate Anime Tower Defense experience you've been waiting for!\n\n🔥 Dive into the world of Anime Royale and invite your favorite heroes to the battlefield! ⚔️ Strategically deploy powerful units and unleash their unique abilities to repel relentless waves of enemies! 🏆 Conquer challenging levels or show off your prowess in the various modes we offer for the ultimate test of your skills!\n\n💻 Available on Desktop, Mobile, Tablet and now on Console!👑","path":"/game/16347800591-anime-royale","slug":"16347800591-anime-royale","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/eb0a9da113bbe271351d08d13980944170b1068131fe58afe98a1c8764010811.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-13516567a109089b51cd2fa8e0531d20/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":51554413,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-21T11:01:58.287Z","creator":{"name":"Anime RoyaIe","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16055525893,"name":"[RELEASE] RNG Odyssey","desc":"⭐ Welcome to RNG Odyssey!\n\n📦 Break CRATES with swords to earn loot!\n🛠️ Craft SWORDS, RUNES, and TOWERS to become stronger!\n💍 Unbox unique ARMOR pieces with various boosts!\n🔥 Show off your rare AURAS and gear!\n🎮Utilise REBIRTHS and SKILL TREES to be overpowered!\n🥇 Find strategies to become the BEST!\n\n🎁 FREE rewar